      "message": "This uploads the benchmarks artifact from the wrong job.\n\nWhat shows it: parsing the change\u0027s `check.yml` as YAML puts `actions/upload-artifact@v4` (`name: benchmarks`, `path: target/vali-bench/latest`) in `review-tools`\u0027s steps, while `bench`\u0027s steps end at `Benchmarks`. `review-tools` never runs the benchmarks, so that path does not exist there and the step fails (upload-artifact errors on missing files by default), failing the job on every push to `main`; meanwhile `bench` no longer publishes its artifact.\n\nFix: move this step back under `bench`, after `Benchmarks`, so `review-tools` ends with the `actions/cache/save` step.",
